# ============================================================
# Host cron job run as ROOT - the unified disk heartbeat.
#
# Install:
#     sudo crontab scripts/crontab.root.sample
# (dr-level monitoring/sampling jobs live in scripts/crontab.sample.)
#
# UNIFIED DISK HEARTBEAT (python, root) - every 15 minutes.
# The single cleaner replacing scripts/cleanup_media.sh + the old
# firewatch-only cleanup cron line. Reads the central global cap from
# config/heartbeat.conf and per-service rules from config/stores/*.conf
# (frigate dir, firewatch docker-exec delegate, watchdog, mosquitto,
# logs). Firewatch evidence is cleaned through its docker-exec store
# profile (the in-container DB-aware worker), so it needs no separate
# line. Logs to heartbeat.conf -> LOG_FILE.
# MUST run as root: the permission pre-flight aborts a non-root real
# run. Inspect with:
#   sudo /usr/bin/python3 /home/dr/frigate/scripts/heartbeat_cleanup.py --check
#   sudo /usr/bin/python3 /home/dr/frigate/scripts/heartbeat_cleanup.py --dry-run
# ============================================================
*/15 * * * * /usr/bin/python3 /home/dr/frigate/scripts/heartbeat_cleanup.py >> /dev/null 2>&1
